# Build context is the parent directory (it holds this repo and the sibling codewright checkout). Send only those two
# trees, and none of their caches, so a build never uploads the rest of the home directory.
*
!codewright
!codegenerator-deepagents
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.next
codewright/backups
codewright/deliveries
codewright/workspaces
codegenerator-deepagents/web/dist
codegenerator-deepagents/.superpowers
